Rule 24    command -> FOR PIDENTIFIER FROM value TO value DO commands ENDFOR
Rule 25    command -> FOR PIDENTIFIER FROM value DOWNTO value DO commands ENDFOR
Rule 26    command -> proc_call SEMICOLON
